      "overall_rating": 0,
      "review_title": "",
      "review_description": "I accepted a quote from Greensure Solar, then without any advise a sub contractor arrived at my house to do some work in preparation for the three phase change over, at this time they also removed the Tariff system for my hot water.  They then removed my current solar panels from the roof.  It has been 6 months since I accepted the quote and 4 months since they removed my previous system, I am still waiting for the 3 phase upgrade to be completed and the solar system to be installed.  Currently they are not answer phone or responding to email messages when I try to ascertain what is going on.  During this wait time, I did receive an email from Greensure requesting me to provide a date for the solar installation.  I advised I would like to provide one, however the 3 phase upgrade has still not been completed.  This appeared to be a surprise to Greensure as they did not know this.  They seem to sub contract out all jobs and it appears that they do not follow up on this.  They have offered currently a total of $500 compensation due to the extensive delays and issues during this process, however, I do not think that I will ever see this compensation or any completed work ie 3 phase upgrade or solar panels from this company.",
